                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A worn edge, a loose joint or a replaced screw records use. Taking time to inspect those details can prevent an enthusiastic repair from becoming another source of damage."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
